---
import Layout from '../../layouts/SystemsLayout.astro';
import ToolStatusBadge from '../../components/ToolStatusBadge.astro';
---

<Layout title="Tool Status Registry | Sans Serif Systems" description="Check the status registry of Systems Bench tools, tracking release stages from live browser sandboxes to planned CLI packages.">
  <div class="glow-blob glow-cyan"></div>
  <div class="glow-blob glow-purple"></div>

  <section class="page-header">
    <span class="meta-badge">ROADMAP & STATUS</span>
    <h1>Tool Status Registry</h1>
    <p>
      An honest inventory of what works right now, what is in active prototyping, and what remains restricted to the private ecosystem.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="docs-container">
    <!-- Left Navigation -->
    <div class="docs-nav card-glass">
      <h5>Architectural Core</h5>
      <a href="/docs/natural-language-programming-stack/">NLP Systems Stack</a>
      <a href="/docs/public-private-boundary/">Public / Private Boundary</a>
      <a href="/docs/tool-status/" class="active">Tool Status Registry</a>
      <a href="/docs/">Introduction</a>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <div class="docs-main card-glass">
      <section class="docs-section">
        <h2>System Status Models</h2>
        <p>
          To maintain transparency and trust, every utility card in the workshop is marked with a status badge indicating its maturity level.
        </p>

        <div style="display: grid; gap: 2rem; margin-top: 2.5rem;">
          <!-- Live Demo -->
          <div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-cyan); padding-left: 1.5rem; background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.01); padding-top: 1rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; border: 1px solid var(--card-border); border-left-width: 3px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <ToolStatusBadge status="live" />
              <strong style="color: var(--text-primary); font-family: var(--font-heading);">Client-Side Live</strong>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0;">
              Runs fully client-side in your web browser. No external API requests, no tracking, and no logins required. Immediate utility.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0;">
              Currently active: Prompt ➔ JSON, Workflow ➔ Diagram
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Local Prototype -->
          <div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-purple); padding-left: 1.5rem; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.01); padding-top: 1rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; border: 1px solid var(--card-border); border-left-width: 3px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <ToolStatusBadge status="prototype" />
              <strong style="color: var(--text-primary); font-family: var(--font-heading);">Browser Prototype / Local CLI Planned</strong>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0;">
              Interactive mockups running fully in-browser as sandboxes. Full terminal/CLI execution packages are planned for offline local use.
            </p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: var(--font-mono); margin-top: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0;">
              Active Prototypes: CSV ➔ Eval Harness, Change Request ➔ HITL Checklist, Repo ➔ Context Pack, Code/Notes ➔ PDF Brief
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Coming Soon -->
          <div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--text-muted); padding-left: 1.5rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.01); padding-top: 1rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; border: 1px solid var(--card-border); border-left-width: 3px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <ToolStatusBadge status="coming-soon" />
              <strong style="color: var(--text-primary); font-family: var(--font-heading);">Planned Concept</strong>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0;">
              Architectural design proposals under consideration. Blueprints are prepared, but active development has not yet begun.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Private System -->
          <div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-orange); padding-left: 1.5rem; background: rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.01); padding-top: 1rem; padding-bottom: 1rem; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; border: 1px solid var(--card-border); border-left-width: 3px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
              <ToolStatusBadge status="private" />
              <strong style="color: var(--text-primary); font-family: var(--font-heading);">Restricted Private Runtime</strong>
            </div>
            <p style="font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--text-secondary); margin-bottom: 0;">
              Underlying infrastructure and runtimes (e.g. BrainBench servers, Flowright governance gates, private database adaptors) that power the production stack and are not distributed publicly.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 4rem 1rem 3rem;
  }

  .meta-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
    border-radius: 99px;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.08);
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.2);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.5vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .page-header p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .docs-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .docs-nav {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }

  .docs-nav h5 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .docs-nav a {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
  }

  .docs-nav a:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
  }

  .docs-nav a.active {
    color: var(--accent-cyan);
    background: rgba(0, 242, 254, 0.05);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .docs-main {
    padding: 3rem;
    border-radius: 12px;
    min-height: 500px;
  }

  .docs-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .docs-section p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .docs-container {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
